The braying of beasts and the holler of the steppe-men can be heard for miles. They'd appeared suddenly, no grass trampled behind them. It is unknown what brought them here, to Ask'lan -- but their beasts graze on [Balhadad's temenoi|a nobleman's pastures|sanctified grounds]. The nomads, seemingly unaware of the concept of owned lands, are nonchalant.

